# Example notebook

A [marimo](https://marimo.io) notebook that writes a table to a Parquet file, queries it with duckdb, and shows the
summary and an altair chart. The page below is the notebook with the output of its cells, exported when the docs are
built. To change it, open it:

```bash
uv run marimo edit notebooks/example.py
```

